<title>JAPAN: Fuji Seito - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Seito - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.74		vs	    4.98</p>
<p> Operating	  345 million	 vs	  323 million</p>
<p> Current	    356 million	 vs	  316 million</p>
<p> Net		  189 million	 vs	  170 million</p>
